---
# Catch2's TEST_CASE/CHECK macros expand into large functions; complexity
# metrics on them say nothing about the test. The analyser also cannot see
# that REQUIRE(x.has_value()) aborts the test before x is dereferenced.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: '-readability-function-cognitive-complexity,-bugprone-unchecked-optional-access'
...
